WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.720
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:21.630
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:28.830
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:38.960
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:44.700
Melt this dark night

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.500
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:55.230
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.560
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.160
As the night will always pass by

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:08.100
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.760
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.160
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:19.500
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.030
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:24.360
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:26.700
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.760
Search for that destination

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.430
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.160
Episode 5

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.860
What with this strong spirit power?

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:53.800
Foundation, Core, Nascent.... and it's still growing rapidly!

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.930
I can't fight with him with my current level!

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.930
At this rate I'll...

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.460
die!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:19.930
Could this man's level is higher than my master?

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.530
Ahhhhhhh!!, Fire Whip!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.860
Shatter!

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.260
He destroyed my magic weapon with just one word.

00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:11.460
My main weapon is gone, there is no hope.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:12.530
You...

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:24.260
It seems that I can't control my fate.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.330
Maybe this time, I will choose my own way to die.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.600
W-Why?

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.330
Miss, you only lost a fight.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:36.330
So what?

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:40.000
If you lose, you can run away! Why bother?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:51.660
You know nothing!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:56.530
How can a weakling like you will know about this cruelty of the world!?

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:04.200
Don't bother! Everyone has their own secrets.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.200
Explain! What was that power just now?

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.130
Actually..

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.530
It was a dream that i always wanted to perfectly act cool for once.

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:23.460
I was so cool!

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:26.400
And..

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:27.530
Hmph!

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.400
Oh, My!

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:30.260
You don't want to say?

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.530
Ying Xiong, let's go somewhere.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.600
Where are we going? It's already mid-night.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.530
Let me rest for a while. I'm still exhausted.

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.330
Get a room.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:41.130
What?

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:46.330
Now Explain -

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:50.460
Why did your spirit power suddenly increase?

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:52.530
Eh! Spirit Power?

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:54.530
Oh! I remember!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.930
At that time, I was praying to god in my mind.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.930
Kyuu Kyuu Nyo Ritsu Ryou

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:02.400
Ba Zha Hei

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.930
Suddenly-

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:06.060
he showed up!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.400
Now i remember,

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:10.800
the fact that you absorb my spirit power is also mystery.

00:05:10.930 --> 00:05:13.130
Eek! I don't know why either~

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.400
Just look at me, so innocent and pure~

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:23.460
It seems that I should take special measures~

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.460
Oh! NO!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:28.460
Muzi, Ya me te!!! (means don't do it)

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.710
What are you doing?

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:36.710
This is the Co-Cultivation Method from Li Family.
*Family aka Clan

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.240
Don't be afraid, Ying Xiong.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:44.710
Li Family Co-Cultivation Method can reconcile Ying and Yang.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:47.570
By letting our spirit power cycle through in our bodies.

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:50.570
After that we can proceed.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.240
Why does this scene looks familiar?

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:58.640
After our spirit power fused together, it feels like the sunlight of a setting sun.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.770
Warm and comfortable....

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:04.910
Everything is exposed to each other without hiding

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.570
It seems that I can see

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.710
the memories hidden deep within her.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.170
Where is this place?

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:27.040
Where is Muzi?

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.510
Why there is a lock?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.370
Wha..what is happening?

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.640
Muzi.

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:39.110
This is the sea of Ying Xiong's consciousness, i just need to get a bit closer,

00:07:39.510 --> 00:07:42.970
then i can detect it with our spirit energy which are from the same origin.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:51.640
This is..

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.570
Ah! I can't move!

00:08:02.840 --> 00:08:04.110
What exactly is this?

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.640
Magic weapon? and it's alive!

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:12.770
Blood?

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:19.770
Why?

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:33.170
Wait..

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:34.570
Here is..

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.110
We are already resonated.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:55.570
Muzi!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.640
Help!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.570
Muzi! Hang on! I'm coming for you!

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:34.040
Who is that?

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:39.240
Plea... please!!

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:44.970
Where is Black Sky?

00:09:55.910 --> 00:09:57.170
Stop!!

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:05.040
So, this is her past?

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:08.310
It's so sad and painful.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.510
But it's all fine now.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.240
I'll protect you!

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:24.640
We 'Li Family' has only 34 descendants in Modern Cultivation World.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.640
Except me, all were killed by him on that night.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:32.440
Just because of our family treasure, Black Sky.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:35.710
But I believe, as long as Black Sky is in my hand-

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.970
I will meet him someday.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.970
My mother and all other relatives who died,

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.370
I MuZi will defenitely

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:45.240
use his blood in libation of you.
*Libation - a drink poured out as an offering to a deity.

00:10:45.710 --> 00:10:46.910
What's his level?

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.710
Can we join forces to defeat him?

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:52.570
has reached Early-stage of Nascent Soul.
The highest cultivation level patriarch

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:54.570
And there are 6 elders who are in the level of Independent Soul

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.040
but we still failed in taking one hit from that person.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:10:58.770
If we meet him now -

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:00.570
we will die.

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:03.240
What a scary guy!

00:11:05.240 --> 00:11:05.640
Muzi

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.370
I will help you. Count me in.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:18.240
After all, we're the couple of Co-Cultivation, ha-ha.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.170
When I just start feeling the kiss,

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.370
I find it's already fleeting away.
*Fleeting - lasting for a very short time

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:41.840
Now, I even want the time to freeze in this moment.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.640
This is your reward for protecting me today!

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:50.910
Muzi, about my spirit power...

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:53.620
I don't want to know anymore.

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:01.690
Although I didn't see the secret in your consciousness sea

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:05.220
but I felt a familiar warmth.

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.290
Which i haven't felt for a long time....

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.150
It's getting late. I want to sleep. You can go now.

00:12:15.350 --> 00:12:16.950
Eh? go back?

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:20.620
You really wanna...

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:29.150
Oh! It's getting late.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.890
I have to go on patrol tonight.

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:36.950
~

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.420
At last, I need to go back to school alone....

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.750
Is this my fate?

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.620
Luckily she didn't ask about the Hun Tian beads.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:51.490
Eh?

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.490
Shit! Where is the Hun Tian beads?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.950
I remember it was in my pocket!

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:56.820
OH MY GOD!! MY TREASURE!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:59.350
How can i survive in this Modern Cultivation World in future?

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:02.150
Argh!!!!

00:13:09.020 --> 00:13:10.020
Young Man~

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.750
You are really a shameless guy!

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:13.750
You call girls at such young age.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:14.750
What?!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.290
Your fiancee is already here....

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:25.290
Hi, daring, I've been waiting for you.

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:26.690
WTF??!!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:37.190
It's the whisper of waves
Waken at nightfall

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:42.920
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:51.250
Blank mood
Scattered time

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:55.990
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:13:57.320 --> 00:14:04.320
Ear is listening
Wind is passed

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:09.920
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:17.920
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:24.720
Bit bit drops into my heart
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:31.720
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:36.850
It rejects of dying alone
